   "source": [
    "--> A fixture is nothing but a mock\n",
    "--> avoid callind data. Use fake data as mocking \n",
    "--> THe fixture will be available throughout the execution of test case\n",
    "--> fixtures can be used as arguments\n",
    "--> FIXTURE SCOPE:\n",
    "    -class\n",
    "    -function \n",
    "    -session \n",
    "    -module\n",
    "--> Parameterized testing "
